    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pro-lībo</span></b> , āre,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to pour out</i>, <i>offer as a
				libation</i> to the gods (Plinian): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina diis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 18, 22, § 117</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">14, 19, 23,
				§ 119</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 4, 11, § 46</span></i>.—<i>Impers. pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fictilibus prolibatur simpuviis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					35, 12, 46, § 158</span></i>
			.</div>
